<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, I was making balloon animals at a party this week that we had here at the office, and every balloon that I started twisting, Torey just kind of freaked out, saying--
<v Ira Glass>像往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人，托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生。你知道，本周我们在办公室开派对时，我在做气球动物，我开始扭动的每一个气球，托里都吓坏了，说——

